#: internal/adapters/cli/commands/hook.go:27
msgid ""
"Manage Gommitlint Git hooks for automatic commit message and signature "
"validation.\n"
"\n"
"Gommitlint manages two hooks:\n"
"  commit-msg   Validates message format (blocks invalid commits)\n"
"  pre-push     Validates signatures when required by the active "
"configuration\n"
"\n"
"Examples:\n"
"  # Show current hook status\n"
"  gommitlint hook status\n"
"\n"
"  # Install hooks in the current repository\n"
"  gommitlint hook install\n"
"\n"
"  # Install hooks globally\n"
"  gommitlint hook install --global\n"
"\n"
"  # Remove hooks from the current repository\n"
"  gommitlint hook remove"
msgstr ""
"Hantera Gommitlint-krokar för automatisk validering av "
"incheckningsmeddelanden och signaturer.\n"
"\n"
"Gommitlint hanterar två krokar:\n"
"  commit-msg   Validerar meddelandeformat (blockerar ogiltiga "
"incheckningar)\n"
"  pre-push     Validerar signaturer när den aktiva konfigurationen kräver "
"det\n"
"\n"
"Exempel:\n"
"  # Visa aktuell krokstatus\n"
"  gommitlint hook status\n"
"\n"
"  # Installera krokar i det aktuella kodförrådet\n"
"  gommitlint hook install\n"
"\n"
"  # Installera krokar globalt\n"
"  gommitlint hook install --global\n"
"\n"
"  # Ta bort krokar från det aktuella kodförrådet\n"
"  gommitlint hook remove"

