#: internal/adapters/cli/commands/config.go:184
msgid ""
"Prints the JSON Schema that describes the gommitlint configuration file.\n"
"\n"
"The schema is generated from the Go config types and embedded in the "
"binary,\n"
"so the output matches this exact gommitlint version. Pipe it to a file to\n"
"validate configs in editors (VS Code, JetBrains) without relying on the\n"
"network-fetched copy from SchemaStore.\n"
"\n"
"Examples:\n"
"  gommitlint config schema > .gommitlint.schema.json\n"
"  gommitlint config schema --compact | jq ."
msgstr ""
"Skriver ut JSON-schemat som beskriver gommitlints konfigurationsfil.\n"
"\n"
"Schemat genereras från Go-konfigurationstyperna och bäddas in i binären,\n"
"så utdata matchar exakt denna gommitlint-version. Skicka det till en fil\n"
"för att validera konfigurationer i redigerare (VS Code, JetBrains) utan\n"
"att förlita dig på den nätverkshämtade kopian från SchemaStore.\n"
"\n"
"Exempel:\n"
"  gommitlint config schema > .gommitlint.schema.json\n"
"  gommitlint config schema --compact | jq ."

