#: internal/adapters/cli/commands/validate.go:42
msgid ""
"validate searches for commit messages that match or violate the configured\n"
"rule and prints each violation found. By default, validate examines the "
"HEAD\n"
"commit in the current repository.\n"
"\n"
"A FILE of \"-\" stands for standard input. If no validation target is "
"specified,\n"
"validate examines the HEAD commit. If --base-branch is given, validate "
"examines\n"
"all commits from the base branch to HEAD.\n"
"\n"
"The exit status is 0 if no violations are found, 1 if violations are found,\n"
"and 2 for fatal errors.\n"
"\n"
"Examples:\n"
"  # Validate the HEAD commit\n"
"  gommitlint validate\n"
"\n"
"  # Validate the last 3 commits\n"
"  gommitlint validate --count 3\n"
"\n"
"  # Validate every commit between main and HEAD\n"
"  gommitlint validate --base-branch main\n"
"\n"
"  # Validate a range (git range syntax)\n"
"  gommitlint validate --range main..feature\n"
"\n"
"  # Validate a message from a file (commit-msg hook)\n"
"  gommitlint validate --message-file .git/COMMIT_EDITMSG\n"
"\n"
"  # Validate a message from stdin\n"
"  echo \"feat: add feature\" | gommitlint validate --message-file -\n"
"\n"
"  # Only run a subset of rules\n"
"  gommitlint validate --rule conventional,signoff\n"
"\n"
"  # Emit machine-readable JSON for a CI pipeline\n"
"  gommitlint validate --format json"
msgstr ""
"validate söker efter incheckningsmeddelanden som bryter mot de "
"konfigurerade\n"
"reglerna och skriver ut varje överträdelse. Som standard granskar validate\n"
"HEAD-incheckningen i det aktuella kodförrådet.\n"
"\n"
"En FIL med värdet \"-\" står för standardinmatning. Om inget valideringsmål\n"
"anges granskas HEAD-incheckningen. Om --base-branch anges granskas alla\n"
"incheckningar från basgrenen till HEAD.\n"
"\n"
"Slutstatus är 0 om inga överträdelser hittas, 1 om överträdelser hittas\n"
"och 2 vid allvarliga fel.\n"
"\n"
"Exempel:\n"
"  # Validera HEAD-incheckningen\n"
"  gommitlint validate\n"
"\n"
"  # Validera de senaste 3 incheckningarna\n"
"  gommitlint validate --count 3\n"
"\n"
"  # Validera varje incheckning mellan main och HEAD\n"
"  gommitlint validate --base-branch main\n"
"\n"
"  # Validera ett intervall (gits intervallsyntax)\n"
"  gommitlint validate --range main..feature\n"
"\n"
"  # Validera ett meddelande från en fil (commit-msg-hook)\n"
"  gommitlint validate --message-file .git/COMMIT_EDITMSG\n"
"\n"
"  # Validera ett meddelande från stdin\n"
"  echo \"feat: add feature\" | gommitlint validate --message-file -\n"
"\n"
"  # Kör endast en delmängd av reglerna\n"
"  gommitlint validate --rule conventional,signoff\n"
"\n"
"  # Mata ut maskinläsbar JSON för en CI-pipeline\n"
"  gommitlint validate --format json"

